  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Blueprint for Mid- and High-Tech Horticulture in India</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dutch horticulture companies will have a clearer picture of business opportunities in the Indian mid- and high-tech market segments, supported by a concrete blueprint and stronger private sector engagement. Retailers and other key stakeholders in India will better understand the added value of Dutch technology, making investment decisions more informed and targeted. This will accelerate sustainable horticultural development and strengthen economic ties between the Netherlands and India.</narrative>
  </description>
